@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra may chu -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach san pham -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet san pham hop le -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. San pham khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Sai kieu tham so ID -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lap trinh gRPC", "description": "Tai lieu bai 5", "price": 80000 }

### 7. Tao san pham sai luat nghiep vu -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "San pham loi", "description": "", "price": -1 }

### 8. Thieu header Content-Type -> 415
POST {{api}}/api/products

{ "name": "Thieu header", "description": "Test 415", "price": 50000 }
